  "releaseNotes": "- Improved EMF/WMF parsing, EMF+ export compatibility, JPEG restart decoding, text layout, clipping, hatch rendering, and font handling.\n    - Added parameterized SVG saving and external image embedding validation.\n    - Expanded metafile comparison and diagnostic regression coverage.",
